#: content/build-it.md:10
msgid ""
"<span style=\"background-color:#e8f4fa\">If you are looking for the pre-"
"compiled packages, visit the [download page](/download/). You can check the "
"packaging status [here](https://repology.org/project/okular/versions)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:12
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "In case you want to compile the development version of KDE and Okular, "
#| "please refer to <a href='%1'>Building and Running KDE Software From "
#| "Source</a> at KDE's TechBase."
msgid ""
"If you want to compile Okular, you need to have a compilation environment "
"set up, which, in general, should be provided by your distribution. In case "
"you want to compile the development version of Okular, please refer to Build "
"from source at KDE's Community Wiki."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite kompajlirati razvojnu verziju KDE i Okular, pogledajte <a "
"href='%1'>Gradnja i pokretanje KDE Softvera iz izvornog koda </a> na KDE's "
"TechBase."

#: content/build-it.md:14
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "You can contact the Okular team in many ways."
msgid "You can download and compile Okular this way:"
msgstr "Možete kontaktirati Okular tim na više načina."

#: content/build-it.md:16
msgid "`git clone https://invent.kde.org/graphics/okular.git`"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:17
msgid "`cd okular`"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:18
msgid "`mkdir build`"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:19
msgid "`cd build`"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:20
msgid "`cmake -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/to/your/install/dir ..`"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:21
msgid "`make`"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:22
msgid "`make install`"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:24
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If you install Okular in a different path than your system kde4 install "
#| "directory it is possible that you need to run"
msgid ""
"If you install Okular in a different path than your system install directory "
"it is possible that you need to run `source build/prefix.sh; okular` so that "
"the correct Okular instance and libraries are picked up."
msgstr ""
"Ako instalirate Okular na drugačiju lokaciju od one na kojoj je sistem kde4 "
"instalacija, moguće je da trebate pokrenuti"

#: content/build-it.md:26
msgid "Optional packages"
msgstr "Izborni paketi"

#: content/build-it.md:28
msgid ""
"There are some optional packages you could install in order to have some "
"more functionalities in Okular. Some might already be packaged for your "
"distro, but other may not. If you want to avoid any issues, stick to the "
"packages supported by your distribution"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:30
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "To compile the PDF backend, you need the Poppler library (<a href='http://"
#| "poppler.freedesktop.org'>http://poppler.freedesktop.org</a>)."
msgid ""
"Poppler (PDF backend): To compile the PDF backend, you need [the Poppler "
"library](http://poppler.freedesktop.org), for which the minimum version "
"required is 0.24"
msgstr ""
"Da biste izradili PDF datoteku potrebna vam je Poppler biblioteka (<a "
"href='http://poppler.freedesktop.org'>http://poppler.freedesktop.org</a>)."

#: content/build-it.md:31
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If your distro does not package libspectre, or the packaged version is "
#| "not enough, you can download it from <a href='http://libspectre."
#| "freedesktop.org'>http://libspectre.freedesktop.org</a>."
msgid ""
"Libspectre: In order to compile and use this PostScipt (PS) backend, you "
"need libspectre >= 0.2. If your distro does not package it, or the packaged "
"version is not enough, you can download it [here](http://libspectre."
"freedesktop.org)"
msgstr ""
"Ako vaša verzija nema libspectre paket ili ako verzija paketa nije dovoljna, "
"možete je skinuti sa <a href='http://libspectre.freedesktop.org'>http://"
"libspectre.freedesktop.org</a>."

#: content/build-it.md:32
msgid ""
"DjVuLibre: To compile the DjVu backend, you need DjVuLibre >= 3.5.17. As "
"with Libspectre, you can get it from your distro or [here](http://djvulibre."
"djvuzone.org)."
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:33
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "libTIFF is needed to compile the TIFF/fax backend. Currently there is no "
#| "minimum required version, so any quite recent version of the library "
#| "available from your distro should work. In case of troubles with that, do "
#| "not hesitate to contact the <a href='contact.php'>Okular developers</a>."
msgid ""
"libTIFF: This is required for TIFF/fax support. Currently there is no "
"minimum required version, so any quite recent version of the library "
"available from your distro should work. In case of trouble, do not hesitate "
"to contact the Okular developers."
msgstr ""
"libTIFF je potreban za izradu TIFF/fax pozadine. Trenutno ne postoji "
"minimalna zahtijevana verzija, tako da bilo koje novije izdanje biblioteke "
"iz vaše verzije trebalo raditi. U slučaju poteškoća kontaktirajte <a "
"href='contact.php'>Okular developers</a>."

#: content/build-it.md:34
msgid ""
"libCHM: This is needed to compile the CHM backend. As with libTIFF, there is "
"no minimum version requirement"
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:35
msgid ""
"Libepub: If you need EPub support, you can install this library from your "
"distro or from [sourceforge](http://sourceforge.net/projects/ebook-tools)."
msgstr ""

#: content/build-it.md:37
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Running Okular"
msgid "Uninstalling Okular"
msgstr "Pokretanje Okulara"

#: content/build-it.md:39
msgid ""
"You can uninstall Okular by running `make uninstall` in your `build` dir. "
"This will remove the application from your system. It will not remove any "
"user data you have viewed, created, or modified with Okular."
msgstr ""

