"dobrodošla je i povratna informacija o postojećim ili novim programima."

#: content/contact.md:15
msgid ""
"IRC: For general chat, we use the IRC [#okular](irc://irc.libera.chat/"
"#okular) and [#kde-devel](irc://irc.libera.chat/#kde-devel) on the [Libera "
"Chat network](https://libera.chat/). Some of the Okular developers can be "
"found hanging there."
