#: content/contact.md:19
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If you prefer using a forum you can use <a href='http://forum.kde.org/"
#| "viewforum.php?f=251'>the Okular forum</a> inside the bigger <a "
#| "href='http://forum.kde.org/'>KDE Community Forums</a>."
