"(http://forum.kde.org/)."
msgstr ""
"Ako preferirate korištenje foruma možete koristiti <a href='http://forum.kde."
"org/viewforum.php?f=251'> Okular forum </a> unutar veće <a href='http://"
"forum.kde.org/'> KDE zajednice foruma </a>."

#: content/contact.md:21
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Bugs and Wishes should be reported to the KDE bug tracker at <a "
#| "href='http://bugs.kde.org'>http://bugs.kde.org</a>."
msgid ""
"Bugs and Wishes: Bugs and Wishes should be reported to the [KDE bug tracker]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/). If you want to help, you can find a list of top "
"bugs [here](https://community.kde.org/Okular)."
msgstr ""
"Greške i želje trebaju biti prijavljene KDE tragaču grešaka na  <a "
"href='http://bugs.kde.org'>http://bugs.kde.org</a>."

